ex(1,"MCQ","Which is a key difference between building a house and building software?",["Software has no requirements","Software is made of abstract logical components and keeps changing","Houses are never designed first","Software cannot be tested"],["Software is made of abstract logical components and keeps changing"],"Abstract, adaptable and evolving vs tangible and static.","Software vs building")
